# Every markdown file in this repository is documentation, and it is written to rules Prettier
# does not know about: a hand-chosen wrap width, tables aligned for reading in the raw file, and
# the em dash ban of CLAUDE.md. Letting `prettier --write .` rewrap it would produce a diff of
# thousands of lines that reviews nothing and hides the actual change. Prose is formatted by the
# writing-style rules; Prettier formats code.
